title: metarecord:bulk
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Bulk operation on the selection or the current query

Sets, adds, removes or unsets a field on a set of metarecords — or deletes them — in one revision: `metarecord:bulk <selection|query> <operation> [field] [type] [value]`. The target is the checked metarecords or what the list shows, and is asked first when not given ([[Editing metarecords in the GUI]]).
